d":5453827,"version":3,"versionNonce":53,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275094,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Per-field,\nuncorrected t, the\ncontrol","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"text-1-0-0","originalText":"Per-field, uncorrected t, the control","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"rJM9Rp89nvc7l_GQlepGA","type":"text","x":239,"y":85,"width":389.5797424316406,"height":225,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"ar","roundness":null,"seed":5558556,"version":3,"versionNonce":54,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275094,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"At guidance 2 the asks blur together:\nneighbouring asks draw the same\ntraining line-ups, so one line-up is\ncounted at many asks. Stronger\nguidance pins each line-up to a few\nasks. The low asks then fill with new\nline-ups that are drawn at one ask only,\nand the high asks narrow onto a few\ntraining line-ups","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-1-1-0","originalText":"At guidance 2 the asks blur together: neighbouring asks draw the same training line-ups, so one line-up is counted at many asks. Stronger guidance pins each line-up to a few asks. The low asks then fill with new line-ups that are drawn at one ask only, and the high asks narrow onto a few training line-ups","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"YbQyKot92pzoMSlaGtTgK","type":"text","x":691,"y":85,"width":541.19970703125,"height":75,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"as","roundness":null,"seed":5663285,"version":3,"versionNonce":55,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275094,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"2,216 of the 2,329 repeats at guidance 2 are a line-up\ndrawn at the next ask too, and 45 of the 50 most\nwidespread line-ups are training line-ups","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-1-2-0","originalText":"2,216 of the 2,329 repeats at guidance 2 are a line-up drawn at the next ask too, and 45 of the 50 most widespread line-ups are training line-ups","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"dJbskTS3XjrW1QXkpe1Sr","type":"text","x":691,"y":180,"width":560.5796508789062,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"at","roundness":null,"seed":5768014,"version":3,"versionNonce":56,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275094,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"The 20 most widespread take 239 ask slots at guidance\n2, 96 at guidance 4 and 34 at guidance 8","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-1-2-1","originalText":"The 20 most widespread take 239 ask slots at guidance 2, 96 at guidance 4 and 34 at guidance 8","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"cwiP11bztglFhRey9BBXc","type":"text","x":691,"y":250,"width":567.4796142578125,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"au","roundness":null,"seed":5872743,"version":3,"versionNonce":57,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275094,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Line-ups not in training go from 502 to 834 to 1,236, and\n1,130 of the 1,236 are drawn at one ask","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-1-2-2","originalText":"Line-ups not in training go from 502 to 834 to 1,236, and 1,130 of the 1,236 are drawn at one ask","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"y5y8o1X4l-sEfe889BVbr","type":"text","x":691,"y":320,"width":368.03973388671875,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"av","roundness":null,"seed":5977472,"version":3,"versionNonce":58,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275094,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Training line-ups go from 1,011 to 890","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-1-2-3","originalText":"Training line-ups go from 1,011 to 890","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"fHFI8lPwCnaUxGCqefQEO","type":"text","x":691,"y":365,"width":540.7196655273438,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"aw","roundness":null,"seed":6082201,"version":3,"versionNonce":59,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275094,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"At ask 21 the count falls from 151 to 58 and the most\ncommon line-up goes from 6 teams to 35","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-1-2-4","originalText":"At ask 21 the count falls from 151 to 58 and the most common line-up goes from 6 teams to 35","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"EepQfFz2DRoBj9lvHuBTs","type":"text","x":37.09008026123047,"y":570.5,"width":145.81983947753906,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"ax","roundness":null,"seed":6186930,"version":3,"versionNonce":60,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Linear, species-\nfirst","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"text-2-0-0","originalText":"Linear, species-first","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"EBi1nZNRUbSecVWmNTkGq","type":"text","x":239,"y":453,"width":360.3197326660156,"height":100,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"ay","roundness":null,"seed":6291659,"version":3,"versionNonce":61,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"The same thing happens, on many of\nthe same line-ups. Its gap to the\ncontrol is small and mostly inside the\nspread between sampling seeds","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-2-1-0","originalText":"The same thing happens, on many of the same line-ups. Its gap to the control is small and mostly inside the spread between sampling seeds","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"SvK5vHvJWfzMd_QJK-y-q","type":"text","x":691,"y":453,"width":462.419677734375,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"az","roundness":null,"seed":6396388,"version":3,"versionNonce":62,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"The two rows share 776 line-ups at guidance 2","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-2-2-0","originalText":"The two rows share 776 line-ups at guidance 2","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"-cqPPOgpUaheADatzlM-j","type":"text","x":691,"y":498,"width":518.459716796875,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b00","roundness":null,"seed":6501117,"version":3,"versionNonce":63,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"The gap of +65 at guidance 2 is +48, +6 and +25 by\nsampling seed","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-2-2-1","originalText":"The gap of +65 at guidance 2 is +48, +6 and +25 by sampling seed","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"8mcH0wH9HlIjG--jDDHPL","type":"text","x":691,"y":568,"width":566.8997192382812,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b01","roundness":null,"seed":6605846,"version":3,"versionNonce":64,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"The gap of −66 at guidance 8 is −2, +2 and +20 by seed,\nso it is noise","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-2-2-2","originalText":"The gap of −66 at guidance 8 is −2, +2 and +20 by seed, so it is noise","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"MIyYx1OiBjFRqj7xKR_Cp","type":"text","x":691,"y":638,"width":554.1196899414062,"height":100,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b02","roundness":null,"seed":6710575,"version":3,"versionNonce":65,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"One difference stands out: at asks 15/24 to 23/24\nunder guidance 8 the control holds 226 line-ups, 93% of\nits teams on training line-ups, and this row holds 345,\nwith 77%","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-2-2-3","originalText":"One difference stands out: at asks 15/24 to 23/24 under guidance 8 the control holds 226 line-ups, 93% of its teams on training line-ups, and this row holds 345, with 77%","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"1-R6jrcsdqW2upp1PQcek","type":"text","x":42.23005676269531,"y":916,"width":135.53988647460938,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b03","roundness":null,"seed":6815304,"version":3,"versionNonce":66,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Linear, random\norder","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"text-3-0-0","originalText":"Linear, random order","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"s9Pqjg4I2u8EftWANK2Dx","type":"text","x":239,"y":776,"width":386.0196838378906,"height":175,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b04","roundness":null,"seed":6920033,"version":3,"versionNonce":67,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"It is the same model as Linear, species-\nfirst, but it rarely puts a training\nteam's six species together, so almost\nevery team in an ask has its own line-\nup. Its total rises with guidance only\nbecause the few repeats between asks\ndisappear","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-3-1-0","originalText":"It is the same model as Linear, species-first, but it rarely puts a training team's six species together, so almost every team in an ask has its own line-up. Its total rises with guidance only because the few repeats between asks disappear","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"WADa5lDRTUBVRAXqvwaTu","type":"text","x":691,"y":776,"width":538.9996337890625,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b05","roundness":null,"seed":7024762,"version":3,"versionNonce":68,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"12% of its teams have a training line-up at guidance 2,\nagainst 82% for species-first","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-3-2-0","originalText":"12% of its teams have a training line-up at guidance 2, against 82% for species-first","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"SjXjz2MtAFN3OLbN1Fvay","type":"text","x":691,"y":846,"width":519.0396728515625,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b06","roundness":null,"seed":7129491,"version":3,"versionNonce":69,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Its 10 most used species take 43% of species slots,\nagainst 64%","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-3-2-1","originalText":"Its 10 most used species take 43% of species slots, against 64%","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"BmlljgmMLR7OMcZhnsHci","type":"text","x":691,"y":916,"width":552.839599609375,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b07","roundness":null,"seed":7234220,"version":3,"versionNonce":70,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"It draws 58 species that appear nowhere in the training\ntable, in 24% of its teams, and species-first draws none","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-3-2-2","originalText":"It draws 58 species that appear nowhere in the training table, in 24% of its teams, and species-first draws none","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"Ya9WCLhP4P-DlUDIFavAB","type":"text","x":691,"y":986,"width":525.1796875,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b08","roundness":null,"seed":7338949,"version":3,"versionNonce":71,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Repeats fall from 1,762 to 578, and most of the lost\nrepeats are line-ups not in training: 1,486 to 479","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-3-2-3","originalText":"Repeats fall from 1,762 to 578, and most of the lost repeats are line-ups not in training: 1,486 to 479","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"2HGWxNNZJiEskRClxsjN4","type":"text","x":691,"y":1056,"width":531.4996337890625,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b09","roundness":null,"seed":7443678,"version":3,"versionNonce":72,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1794661275095,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Teams with a new line-up win 0.236, against 0.323 for\nteams with a training line-up","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":"text-3-2-4","originalText":"Teams with a new line-up win 0.236, against 0.323 for teams with a training line-up","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25}],"appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","gridSize":null},"files":{}}